# Actions Spec

Read `.cursor/skills/eva-specs/actions.md` (full: `docs/ACTIONS_SPEC_v0.1.md`).

- Action hides tool recipe from FSM; FSM uses action ids only
- Recipe steps: `id`, `tool`, `command`, `input`, optional `when` — not `args`
- Templates: `{{input.*}}`, `{{vars.*}}`, `{{steps.<id>.result}}`
- Completion event: `action.{id}.completed`
- Step `when` = local logic; FSM `guard` = process logic
